  "summary": "Scam compounds in Myawaddy Township, Karen State, Myanmar, on the border opposite Mae Sot, Thailand, hold workers forced under threat of violence to run cyber scams. The US Treasury sanctioned the Karen National Army (KNA) and its leader Saw Chit Thu in May 2025, saying survivors of KK Park reported guards wearing KNA insignia, and in September 2025 sanctioned She Zhijiang and Yatai companies behind Yatai New City in Shwe Kokko. In October 2025 Myanmar's military raided KK Park and arrested 2,198 people, and more than 1,500 people from 28 countries fled into Mae Sot.",
